{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time to Pay the Bills is a financial roguelike that lets you experience paying off debt in a fun and entertaining way. You have a board filled with small buttons, each with different values. Alongside the board is your collection of marbles. Choose one and shoot it in the desired direction to hit as many buttons as possible.<br><br>All hits are automatically calculated by a special device on the left side. When the marble stops, your paycheck is ready, and the debt takes a hit. Between rounds, you can boost your run with extra buffs and effects by acquiring special coins. Collect multiple coins to trigger fantastic combos and unlock powerful synergies that shape your strategy and keep you ahead of rising bills.<br><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your board with buttons made of various metals. Each metal (color) has a unique role in gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with dozens of unique marbles, each with special effects that increase your earnings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire game-changing coins to boost your run with extra buffs, triggers, combos, and synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Withstand a wave of rising bills by making smart moves and choosing the right strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931600/extras/070d7c8e2e5cbd143a6cd55b003cb7ef.avif?t=1773162425\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931600/extras_big/070d7c8e2e5cbd143a6cd55b003cb7ef.webp?t=1773162425 width=1560 height=305 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3931600?t=1773162425","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931600/3530dc6710c0c04fccf2965a00842b27011